g style to compress lines by tomoya · Pull Request #4 · yuki-yano/slack-hot-channel-deno","title_link":"https://github.com/yuki-yano/slack-hot-channel-deno/pull/4","text":"Merge title and value data to value Number symbol use dot instead of sharp After Before","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/9b565361067f70beba459bb032a9a778b96092cb4136462f99d1b2eb88e0b68d/yuki-yano/slack-hot-channel-deno/pull/4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/yuki-yano/slack-hot-channel-deno/pull/4","original_url":"https://github.com/yuki-yano/slack-hot-channel-deno/pull/4"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kBso"}]},{"client_msg_id":"222993D4-DE77-4230-8E0C-8302873913B2","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"招待きた :tada: ","ts":"1622161528.036400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ukd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c71c0d78-0c34-46fc-bbcf-3cc60b003a40","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"thincaさんもinviteしておこう","ts":"1622161393.035900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D3ND"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4c8248e5-d8e7-4bd7-abdf-aa278d2913bf","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"もしくはdocker-composeに閉じさせてRedis置いて前日のデータを永続化しておくかの二択かな","ts":"1622161364.035700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"My="}]},{"client_msg_id":"70eb8b50-8052-4636-89b1-dae4b6d1c156","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"いけたかな","ts":"1622161311.035200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FPP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e1f7182d-dcdb-4098-8af5-b60344c5fddd","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"どこでinviteするんだっけ・・・","ts":"1622161286.035000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qX=P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5e36aa7-9b8b-4ec6-ab9c-74c743e241df","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あ、そうですね","ts":"1622161260.034800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W27=O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"245c7f9f-b1cf-4acd-9036-fc9cb5f0ed01","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"推移の計測で集計には\n```const LATEST = MOMENT.clone().unix().toString();\nconst OLDEST = MOMENT.clone().subtract(1, \"days\").unix().toString();```\nの部分をsubstractで1日増やすのが暫定で楽かなーって思ってます","ts":"1622161254.034600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MuTj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F8DF48FB-F670-4428-886B-02AA24613BB1","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003c@U8996GYBF\u003e\n可能であればリポジトリにコミット権限貰えると嬉しいです。アカウント名は tomoya です。","ts":"1622161254.034500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0V8EX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5DF85797-46E5-4405-AD90-175312E42DC3","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"まだ余裕あるし、環境面ではボットの追加は問題ないかと思います。","ts":"1622161144.032500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zozh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"37c2d57a-4970-46a1-84f5-df0362b012f7","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```export { printf, sprintf } from \"\u003chttps://deno.land/std@0.94.0/fmt/printf.ts\u003e\";```\nフォーマット整理にはこういうのがあるので、こっちに移行していくのはよさそうに思ってます","ts":"1622161115.032000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f9RN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41b146ab-cc5f-4c2c-b292-9f740a4d0da5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"作れるならそうですね","ts":"1622161092.030900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O8N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"028D2D6A-78B1-4D11-AAF0-1E66CC45A387","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あと、トークンは権限を開発用のボットを用意した方が良いでしょうね。","ts":"1622161069.030400","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1622161081.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"x7Kc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0d7c572-dde7-49d0-a338-f0baa5cb1cad","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"テストデータ作って自分でやった方がいい、とてもわかる","ts":"1622161057.030300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=6c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d22d7fb-a832-45ca-aac6-ceebf505b487","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ありがとうございます、フォーマットはひとまずなんとなくいい感じで適当でOKです","ts":"1622161038.029400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qJyXr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4C51C6DF-F4E1-4674-B97A-A7ABE3CDEF90","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"大丈夫です！","ts":"1622161019.028600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kOF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"33d6f961-1bf9-4b65-ad12-4dcd7af3fb4a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"もし借りれたら自分でやっていけるんですが","ts":"1622161004.028200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q+c=v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"afbed9b4-1ade-4e87-b11d-ab679fe686ee","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"thincaさんに借りれるか次第なんですが、そっちで直して貰うことって可能でしょうか","ts":"1622160995.027800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uMy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6A2A746C-176F-44A8-96D6-EB83C96815C6","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ありだと思います。こちらの検証環境だとデータが少なかったので2行の方が見やすかったんですが、長いと1行の方が見やすそうだと思いました。","ts":"1622160973.027200","team"